{"id":"55889258754cb9d9","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-kernel-image.md","title":"Kernel and Image","display":"df-kernel-image — Kernel and Image","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-kernel-image","aliases":["58-df-kernel-image"],"display":"df-kernel-image — Kernel and Image","depends_on":["[[58-df-linear-map]]","[[58-df-vector-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-kernel-image"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-kernel-image</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kernel-image — Kernel and Image"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"58-df-linear-map\">58-df-linear-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"58-df-vector-space\">58-df-vector-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\\subseteq V^{8}\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\\subseteq V^{8}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Kernel}_S,\\mathrm{Image}_S\\subseteq V^{9}\">\\(\\mathrm{Kernel}_S,\\mathrm{Image}_S\\subseteq V^{9}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearKernel}_S,\\mathrm{LinearImage}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearKernel}_S,\\mathrm{LinearImage}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,W,T,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W\\in V\">\\(U,W,T,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W\\in V\\)</span> (two vector spaces and a candidate map)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\\)</span> (eight-place linear-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"58-df-linear-map\">58-df-linear-map</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Kernel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Kernel}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Image}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Image}_S\\)</span> (fully explicit predicates) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearKernel}_S,\\mathrm{LinearImage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearKernel}_S,\\mathrm{LinearImage}_S\\)</span> (four-place existential projections)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}image\\text{-}kernel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Kernel}_S(K,T,U,W,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,U,W,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W)\\land\n\\exists0_W\\in W\\;\\bigl(\\forall w\\in W\\;(0_W+_Ww=w)\\land K=\\{u\\in U\\mid T(u)=0_W\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}image\\text{-}kernel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Kernel}_S(K,T,U,W,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,U,W,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W)\\land\n\\exists0_W\\in W\\;\\bigl(\\forall w\\in W\\;(0_W+_Ww=w)\\land K=\\{u\\in U\\mid T(u)=0_W\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}image\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Image}_S(I,T,U,W,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,U,W,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W)\\land I=T[U]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}image\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Image}_S(I,T,U,W,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,U,W,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W)\\land I=T[U]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}image\\text{-}aliases}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LinearKernel}_S(K,T,U,W)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Kernel}_S(K,T,U,W,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LinearImage}_S(I,T,U,W)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Image}_S(I,T,U,W,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}image\\text{-}aliases}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LinearKernel}_S(K,T,U,W)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Kernel}_S(K,T,U,W,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LinearImage}_S(I,T,U,W)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Image}_S(I,T,U,W,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The existential projections have distinct names, so the canonical kernel and image relations keep a unique nine-place signature.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-linear-map","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-linear-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-vector-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-linear-map","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S$ (eight-place linear-map predicate, see [[58-df-linear-map]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\\subseteq V^{8}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Kernel}_S,\\mathrm{Image}_S\\subseteq V^{9}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearKernel}_S,\\mathrm{LinearImage}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"U,W,T,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Kernel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Image}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearKernel}_S,\\mathrm{LinearImage}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}image\\text{-}kernel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Kernel}_S(K,T,U,W,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,U,W,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W)\\land\n\\exists0_W\\in W\\;\\bigl(\\forall w\\in W\\;(0_W+_Ww=w)\\land K=\\{u\\in U\\mid T(u)=0_W\\}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}image\\text{-}image}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Image}_S(I,T,U,W,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,U,W,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W)\\land I=T[U]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}image\\text{-}aliases}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{LinearKernel}_S(K,T,U,W)&\\leftrightarrow\\exists k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Kernel}_S(K,T,U,W,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LinearImage}_S(I,T,U,W)&\\leftrightarrow\\exists k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Image}_S(I,T,U,W,k,+_U,\\odot_U,+_W,\\odot_W).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1844,"backlinks":[{"id":"2754b0b2a80093e8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fc4e59ceee1c854e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends